    "body": "I tested out some combinations of size and multiple. How do you think they should behave? Am I missing any mismatch cases?\n\n<details>\n<summary>HTML</summary>\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<style>\nselect {\n  appearance: base-select;\n}\np {\n  font-family: monospace;\n}\n</style>\n\n<p>size=-1</p>\n<select size=-1>\n  <option>one</option>\n  <option>two</option>\n  <option>three</option>\n</select>\n\n<p>size=0</p>\n<select size=0>\n  <option>one</option>\n  <option>two</option>\n  <option>three</option>\n</select>\n\n<p>size=1</p>\n<select size=1>\n  <option>one</option>\n  <option>two</option>\n  <option>three</option>\n</select>\n\n<p>size=2</p>\n<select size=2>\n  <option>one</option>\n  <option>two</option>\n  <option>three</option>\n</select>\n\n<p>multiple size=-1</p>\n<select multiple size=-1>\n  <option>one</option>\n  <option>two</option>\n  <option>three</option>\n</select>\n\n<p>multiple size=0</p>\n<select multiple size=0>\n  <option>one</option>\n  <option>two</option>\n  <option>three</option>\n</select>\n\n<p>multiple size=1</p>\n<select multiple size=1>\n  <option>one</option>\n  <option>two</option>\n  <option>three</option>\n</select>\n\n<p>multiple size=2</p>\n<select multiple size=2>\n  <option>one</option>\n  <option>two</option>\n  <option>three</option>\n</select>\n\n```\n</details>\n\n<img width=\"178\" height=\"770\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b5ca8f48-e0ec-43b9-9355-85dd4d42b2bc\" />",
